 "id": 589151600858,
 "title": "Gravel Bike by Paul",
 "body_html": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"680938726\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.680938726 c299\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What made you decide to build a bamboo bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">I have many types of bikes but was up for a challenge and something different. The ride qualities and low carbon footprint were appealing</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"845063547\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\"><span class=\"M7eMe\"></span></div>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">Did you enjoy building the bicycle from scratch and would you recommend the experience?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Absolutely. Brought out some latent OCD tendencies, but mentally stimulating and often challenging problem solving.</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"805044919\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c304\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What did you find most difficult about your bike build?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">The learning curve working with the resin. It IS temperature sensitive regarding set up time. Recommend small batches in case it gets away from you.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"1370153519\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1370153519\"><span class=\"M7eMe\"></span></div>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1370153519\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What was the easiest part of the build?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Guidance from corresponding with James</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"862135650\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.862135650 c309\"><span class=\"M7eMe\"></span></h4>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.862135650 c309\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">How would you describe the ride of your finished bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Still wait for salt free roads in western NY.,USA</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"1476906189\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1476906189 c312\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What would you improve about the build experience or your finished bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Be sure to keep my tubes wrapped for humidity during down time to prevent some cracks opening. I measured chain stay clearance for cranks off another bike. A 2x setup puts the cranks out farther from the stays. I chose a 1x, and the end of the crank arm was very close to hitting the stay. Had to do a bit of relief. Also check the derailleur hanger alignment when finished. Be sure jigs are stable from the beginning.</div>\n<div class=\"halo-row\">\n<div class=\"first-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/1F0E7C2B-4960-4866-B30B-6E2628EB47E8_-_Paul_Ziarnowski.jpg?v=1677406527\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"first-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/9BEA08C2-626E-4458-8FD1-8A05DC24A9A9_-_Paul_Ziarnowski.webp?v=1680244698\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"first-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/68337CA8-1A9E-4E38-A97F-DBB83915F62D_-_Paul_Ziarnowski.webp?v=1680244753\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"first-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/2123849A-7ECC-4CF1-9F78-E331757519C8_-_Paul_Ziarnowski.jpg?v=1677406579\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"first-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/CCBB7BAF-2AB4-4DC4-90D5-5168915D8913_-_Paul_Ziarnowski.jpg?v=1677406594\" alt=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"first-image\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0502/8695/2631/files/D8E7EBCA-5DCD-4207-802D-5A6F657F3253_-_Paul_Ziarnowski.webp?v=1680244817\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<style><!--\n  .first-image {\n    width: 50%;\n    padding: 10px;\n}\n.first-image img {\n    width: 600px;\n    height: 455px;\n}\n  \n--></style>",
